  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Support Macroeconomic Stabilization</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Fortalecimiento a la Estabilizacin Macroeconmica</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es facilitar la estabilidad macroeconmica del Ecuador. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) fortalecer la sostenibilidad fiscal salvaguardando la proteccin social; y (ii) fortalecer la estabilidad del mercado monetario.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the program is to facilitate macroeconomic stability in Ecuador. The specific objectives are: (i) to strengthen fiscal sustainability while safeguarding social protection; and (ii) to strengthen monetary market stability.</narrative>
  </description>
